  ('7-62mm-dragunov-sniper-svd-nb', '7.62mm Dragunov Sniper (SVD)', 'nightbane', 'weapon', NULL, 1570, NULL, '4D6', 0, '4265ft (1300m)', '20 round box mag.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Country: U.S.S.R.. Cartridge: 7.62mm. Barrel length: 547mm (1225mm). Muzzle velocity: 830m/s. WEIGHT NOT STORED: printed 216 gives Weight: 4.3 with NO UNIT, confirmed on a render, so the book omits it rather than the OCR. Every neighbouring rifle is in kg, so 4.3kg (9.5 lbs) is almost certainly meant, but the unit is not supplied here.', 'Nightbane RPG p.216'),
